# Base CPython profile: disable optional/bulky stdlib extension modules.
# This is a DISABLE LIST (makesetup "first rule wins"): names listed here are
# turned off unless removed by merge intersection with another selected profile.
# _hashlib is intentionally NOT listed; CPython/wyng security paths need it and
# modules/cpython depends on openssl.
*disabled*
_uuid
lzma
curses
dbm
nis
ssl
readline
_tkinter
_gdbm
_decimal
